                <!-- 360 Servo (Turret rotation) TODO: This seems to be the yaw joint -->
                <!-- The structure in exported URDF is weird. "Turret" and "Nerf-Dart-Launcher_360_servo" are children of Motorbracket... 
         usually the motor bracket would be ON the turret. 
         Assuming the provided hierarchy is: Parent (Robot) -> Motorbracket -> Turret? 
         Wait, let's look at the URDF again:
         Motorbracket -> Turret (fixed)
         Motorbracket -> Servo (fixed) -> 360_servo (continuous)? 
    -->

        </xacro:macro>
</robot>
